# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit real values.

# --- Supabase (public; compiled into the browser bundle) ---
# Supabase Dashboard > Project Settings > API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key

# These two are public by design: the anon key is protected by Row Level
# Security, not by secrecy.
#
# The Google Books API key is NOT here and must never be. It is a Supabase
# Edge Function secret (Dashboard > Edge Functions > Secrets). Anything
# prefixed VITE_ is compiled into the JavaScript served to every visitor,
# so a key placed here is a leaked key. The browser never calls Google
# Books directly - requests go through the `books` Edge Function.
